.SH NAME
niac-mibzip-compress - Compress a text SNMP walk file


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBniac mibzip compress   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Compress a text SNMP walk file into NIAC MibZip binary format.

.PP
The input file is parsed as a standard snmpwalk-style text file. The output
file is created with owner-only permissions.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for compress


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--storage-keep\fP=500
	Run history records to keep, pruned oldest first on start (0 keeps every run)

.PP
\fB--storage-path\fP=""
	Path to NIAC run history database (default: ~/.niac/niac.db)


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  niac mibzip compress walks/cisco-c9300.walk walks/cisco-c9300.mz
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBniac-mibzip(1)\fP


